  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="why" id="why">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">问题所在</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">AI 在写代码。<br><em>但你不知道写了什么。</em></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        每次对话都从零开始。AI 不记得你的架构决策，不理解你的约束条件，也没有一致的策略。Architext 将这些上下文持久化在你的代码仓库中。
      </p>

      <div class="why-grid">
        <table class="compare-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th></th>
              <th>AI 全自主模式</th>
              <th>Architext</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="label">核心假设</td>
              <td class="bad">AI 知道你想要什么</td>
              <td class="good">你来定义，AI 来执行</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="label">你的角色</td>
              <td class="bad">审阅者 — 事后看结果</td>
              <td class="good">决策者 — 构建前确认</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="label">上下文</td>
              <td class="bad">每次对话重置</td>
              <td class="good">持久化在仓库，随时可用</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="label">架构</td>
              <td class="bad">AI 隐式决定</td>
              <td class="good">你显式拥有每一个决策</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="value-cards">
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>文档驱动</h3>
            <p>代码是文档的下游产物。每个功能都从持久化在仓库中的规格说明开始。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>技术无关</h3>
            <p>不限制技术栈，与你想做什么产品无关 — CLI、Web、小程序、API 都可以。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>会话持久</h3>
            <p>上下文在会话、团队成员和 AI 工具切换之间保持不变。规格文档永久存储在仓库中。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>面向中小型应用</h3>
            <p>小团队 + AI 开发的文档驱动方案。AI 始终理解你的项目，你始终掌握架构决策。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="workflow" id="workflow">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">命令生命周期</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">完整工作流。<br><em>每个命令都有它的位置。</em></h2>

      <!-- Phase 1: Initialize -->
      <div class="lifecycle-phase">
        <h3 class="phase-title">阶段 1: 初始化</h3>
        <div class="init-cards">
          <div class="init-card">
            <div class="init-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <code>/archi.start</code>
            <span class="init-label">新项目</span>
            <span class="init-desc">从零开始创建，包含愿景、路线图和技术栈</span>
          </div>
          <div class="init-divider">
            <span>或</span>
          </div>
          <div class="init-card">
            <div class="init-icon inherit">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/>
                <polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"/>
                <line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <code>/archi.inherit</code>
            <span class="init-label">现有代码库</span>
            <span class="init-desc">将现有代码纳入 architext 框架管理</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 2: UI Design (Optional) -->
      <div class="lifecycle-phase optional">
        <h3 class="phase-title">
          阶段 2: UI 设计
          <span class="phase-badge">仅 UI 项目</span>
        </h3>
        <div class="ui-card">
          <div class="ui-flow">
            <div class="ui-node">
              <div class="stage-icon">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/>
                  <path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <code>/archi.ui</code>
              <span class="ui-label">生成 UI 概念</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ui-output">
              <span class="output-label">产出:</span>
              <span class="output-items">页面, UI 上下文</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 3: Develop -->
      <div class="lifecycle-phase">
        <h3 class="phase-title">阶段 3: 开发</h3>
        <div class="dev-cycle">
          <!-- Plan -->
          <div class="dev-stage">
            <div class="stage-node">
              <div class="stage-icon">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                  <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <code>/archi.plan</code>
              <span class="stage-title">规划</span>
              <span class="stage-output">产出: 规格, 计划, 任务文档</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Arrow 1 -->
          <div class="stage-arrow">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M5 12h14M14 6l6 6-6 6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <!-- Code -->
          <div class="dev-stage">
            <div class="stage-node">
              <div class="stage-icon">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/>
                  <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <code>/archi.code</code>
              <span class="stage-title">编码</span>
              <span class="stage-output">产出: 可运行代码</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Arrow 2 -->
          <div class="stage-arrow">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M5 12h14M14 6l6 6-6 6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <!-- Audit (Optional) -->
          <div class="dev-stage">
            <div class="stage-node optional-node">
              <div class="optional-badge">可选</div>
              <div class="stage-icon">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/>
                  <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <code>/archi.audit</code>
              <span class="stage-title">审查</span>
              <span class="stage-output">产出: 审查报告, 修复建议</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Loop arrow back to Plan -->
          <div class="cycle-arrow">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M4 4v6M4 10h6M20 20v-6M20 14h-6"/>
              <path d="M20 10a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"/>
              <path d="M4 14a8 8 0 0 0 16 0"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="cycle-label">循环</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 4: Iterate -->
      <div class="lifecycle-phase">
        <h3 class="phase-title">阶段 4: 迭代与维护</h3>
        <div class="iterate-grid">
          <div class="iterate-card">
            <span class="cmd">/archi.scope</span>
            <h4>追加需求</h4>
            <p>将新需求增量分解为路线图任务</p>
          </div>
          <div class="iterate-card">
            <span class="cmd">/archi.edit</span>
            <h4>变更规格</h4>
            <p>更新功能规格，历史永久保留</p>
          </div>
          <div class="iterate-card">
            <span class="cmd">/archi.fix</span>
            <h4>修复缺陷</h4>
            <p>对照规格进行根因诊断，精准修复</p>
          </div>
          <div class="iterate-card">
            <span class="cmd">/archi.revise</span>
            <h4>调整架构</h4>
            <p>项目级变更：影响分析 + 级联更新</p>
          </div>
          <div class="iterate-card">
            <span class="cmd">/archi.map</span>
            <h4>同步代码库</h4>
            <p>扫描代码并同步 map.json 映射</p>
          </div>
          <div class="iterate-card">
            <span class="cmd">/archi.ref</span>
            <h4>引用管理</h4>
            <p>管理外部参考和依赖资料</p>
          </div>
          <div class="iterate-card">
            <span class="cmd">/archi.recover</span>
            <h4>恢复数据</h4>
            <p>从 pack.xml 还原数据，用于升级或迁移</p>
          </div>
          <div class="iterate-card">
            <span class="cmd">/archi.script</span>
            <h4>生成脚本</h4>
            <p>基建完成后生成自动化脚本（验证/启动/重置）</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <h2>带着意图开始构建。</h2>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>Architext — <a href="https://github.com/JiuNian3219/architext">GitHub</a> · MIT 许可证</p>
